[heading]Version 0.5.26[/heading]

[list]
[*]Added a short trader-transport transition before travel, with a brief hidden-view delay, an optional vehicle sound, and an arrival message.
[*]Added optional distance-based travel costs using a configurable item, with gas as the default. Disabled by default, so nothing changes until you enable it.
[*]Destination choices show the configured travel cost before you commit to a trip, and the destination screen shows the active access mode and page status.
[*]Added paging controls so long visited-trader lists stay fully reachable.
[*]Fixed travel cost on dedicated servers: the cost item is checked and consumed on the client, so the inventory stack count correctly reflects what a trip costs.
[*]The travel overlay now stays up until the destination area is loaded on the client, so the trader you arrive at is rendered before the arrival message appears.
[*]No save reset required when updating from 0.4.x.
[/list]
